    <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Exception outcomes (EF-01 … EF-04)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Unresolved key after tool list + both config shapes → stop and report capability + sources searched; never substitute a guessed ID.&lt;br&gt;Unknown nested tool name → report the semantic query and candidates returned; never invent a tool name.&lt;br&gt;Wrong argument key (tool_name) → server rejects; correct to toolName and retry once; repeat occurrence is a prompt defect.&lt;br&gt;ID-form mismatch (direct vs Code Mode) → report detected mode, retry once with the other form, then fail." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
